Package: hfdPeriodFertilityTable
Type: Package
Title: Production of period fertility tables using the Human Fertility
        Database methodology
Version: 2.0-1077
Date: 2015-04-26
Author: Edward Nash <nash@demogr.mpg.de>
Maintainer: Edward Nash <edward.nash@gmx.de>
Depends: hfdCohortFertilityTable, hfdParity, abind
Description: This package provides functions to produce period fertility tables using the methods described
  in the Human Fertility Database Methods Protocol. Either individual indicators or entire tables may be
  produced.
Copyright: Human Fertility Database project - Max Planck Institute for
        Demographic Research (Germany) and Vienna Institute of
        Demography (Austria)
